            "star_rating": 5,
            "title": "",
            "text": "<p>\"Being “heavy-in-the-middle” is one of the top concerns for women over 40. Shilajit Gummies’s abdominal-fat-management formula helps women look & feel fabulous in the latest styles, cuts and fits from their favorite boutique.\"</p>",
