            "muted_autoplay": true,
            "title": "Fat-Loss Specific",
            "text": "<p>This formula helps women over 30 fight stubborn weight by combining metabolism-activating <strong>Ginger</strong> and <strong>Black Musli</strong> with hormone-balancing adaptogens. Together, they support healthy fat metabolism, reduce water retention, and deliver sustained energy—without the crash or stimulants found in other fat-burning solutions.</p>",
