    "collapsible_content_HkG9n6": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "collapsible_row_zC6Czf": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How are Wellness Nest Shilajit Gummies different from regular Shilajit supplements?",
            "icon": "quiz",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Not all Shilajit is created equal.<br/><br/>Many products on the market use diluted resin, synthetic fillers, or low-potency extracts.<br/><br/>Wellness Nest Shilajit Gummies deliver a clinically formulated dose of <strong>purified Himalayan Shilajit</strong>, combined with adaptogens like <strong>Ashwagandha and Gokshura</strong>, designed for <strong>women’s hormonal, mental, and physical well-being</strong>.<br/><br/>It’s sugar-free, lab-tested, and optimized for daily use — no mixing or messy resin handling required.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_qrGA9d": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How are these gummies different from typical “energy boosters” or hormone pills?",
            "icon": "quiz",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Typical boosters rely on caffeine or synthetic ingredients for quick effects.<br/><br/>Wellness Nest Shilajit Gummies work by <strong>nourishing your endocrine and adrenal systems</strong> — helping regulate cortisol, support estrogen balance, and reduce fatigue naturally.<br/><br/>Instead of crashing, you’ll feel more consistent energy, sharper focus, and restored vitality — especially during hormonal shifts like PMS, postpartum, or menopause.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_rmQF7P": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What symptoms do Shilajit Gummies help with for women?",
            "icon": "quiz",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>This formula was designed with women’s wellness in mind. Based on customer feedback, many women report relief from:<br/><br/>- Hormonal fatigue & low energy<br/>- Mood swings & brain fog<br/>- Bloating and poor digestion<br/>- Joint stiffness (especially in knees and hips)<br/>- Low libido or emotional burnout<br/>- Poor recovery or sleep disruption<br/><br/>Consistent use supports better metabolic function, sharper mental clarity, and more emotional balance — with benefits building over time.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_trmaKd": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "When will I start seeing results?",
            "icon": "quiz",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Many women report feeling more energized and mentally clear within the <strong>first 7–14 days</strong>.<br/><br/>However, real transformation happens over time — especially as adaptogens and Shilajit compounds build in your system.<br/><br/>For best results, we recommend using the <strong>60-count (1-month)</strong> supply consistently, or opting for the <strong>3-pack</strong> to support 90-day hormonal balance.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_Gz6jXJ": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Do I need to refrigerate these gummies?",
            "icon": "quiz",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>No refrigeration needed.<br/><br/>Our gummies are <strong>shelf-stable</strong> and formulated to maintain potency at room temperature.<br/><br/>Store in a cool, dry place and keep the lid tightly closed after use.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_XA6Kqd": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Will these still work if I don’t change my diet or exercise?",
            "icon": "quiz",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Wellness Nest Shilajit Gummies are designed to <strong>support your lifestyle</strong>, not replace it.<br/><br/>They help <strong>enhance the effects of a healthy routine</strong> — supporting recovery, hormone harmony, and nutrient uptake.<br/><br/>Even if you're not on a strict diet or exercise plan, many women still notice improved energy, digestion, and mood.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_gDKUrK": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Do Shilajit Gummies have any side effects?",
            "icon": "quiz",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>The vast majority of users do <strong>not</strong> report any side effects.<br/><br/>Our gummies are <strong>free from caffeine, dairy, gluten, soy, and artificial stimulants</strong>.<br/><br/>A few people may experience mild bloating or detox-like effects in the first few days — a natural response as your gut and hormones begin to rebalance.<br/><br/>As always, discontinue use and consult your doctor if you experience any unusual symptoms.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_76bB7Y": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can I take these if I’m on medication or managing a health condition?",
            "icon": "quiz",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Please consult your healthcare provider before starting any supplement, especially if you:<br/><br/>Are pregnant, breastfeeding, or undergoing fertility treatments<br/><br/>Take medications like NSAIDs, hormone therapies, blood thinners, or thyroid meds<br/><br/>Are being treated for autoimmune, adrenal, or metabolic conditions<br/>Shilajit is powerful — so always pair it with professional guidance when in doubt.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_TVNFXE": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Are there allergens or animal products in this formula?",
            "icon": "quiz",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>No. Our gummies are:<br/><br/>Dairy-free<br/><br/>Gluten-free<br/><br/>Soy-free<br/><br/>Shellfish-free<br/><br/>Made without common allergens<br/>They are also pork-free and do not contain gelatin, making them suitable for most dietary lifestyles.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_nqD9hG": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "I’m vegan / paleo / keto. Can I still take these?",
            "icon": "quiz",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Yes — our formula is compatible with most clean diets.<br/>It contains zero added sugar, and we use plant-based sweeteners to deliver a pleasant taste without spiking insulin levels.<br/>Many keto and paleo users report improved stamina and metabolic resilience while using our gummies.<br/><br/>Is this a one-time purchase or a subscription?<br/>We offer both.<br/><br/>Choose one-time purchase if you want to try it out risk-free.<br/><br/>Select Subscribe & Save to get 20% off and have your gummies automatically delivered every month — cancel anytime.<br/>Both options include our 90-day money-back guarantee.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_xQrpXj": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Where can I find reviews about these gummies?",
            "icon": "quiz",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Scroll up to the Reviews section on this page.<br/>You’ll find real feedback from verified Wellness Nest customers — many of whom are women just like you, managing PMS, perimenopause, or hormonal burnout.<br/>We also include review videos, so you can hear directly from real women sharing their transformation stories.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_4bAkmy": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can Shilajit Gummies cure hormonal disorders or chronic illnesses?",
            "icon": "quiz",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>No — this product is not intended to <strong>diagnose, treat, or cure</strong> any medical condition.<br/><br/>It is a wellness supplement that supports natural hormonal, metabolic, and emotional functions.<br/><br/>If you suffer from <strong>PCOS, endometriosis, thyroid disease, or chronic inflammation</strong>, consult your doctor before use.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_BF8899": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How long will shipping take?",
            "icon": "quiz",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>We ship from our U.S. warehouse, and most orders arrive within:<br/><br/>3–5 business days (Express)<br/>5–10 business days (Standard)</p><p><br/>You’ll receive tracking information once your order ships. We work hard to get your order to you as quickly as possible.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_rET8jK": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How About Guarantee?",
            "icon": "quiz",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>You are protected by our <strong>90-Day 100% Money-Back Guarantee</strong>. If you don’t see or feel a difference, reach out within 90 days for a <strong>full refund—no questions asked</strong>.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
